只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Reusable Agent Team presets for DeepSeek Harness: a captain plus members with their own prompt, model, reasoning effort, and tools.","id":"gh:1411553473","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-agent-team-presets","slug":"bloodarea/dsh-agent-team-presets","topics":["agent-presets","agent-teams","ai-agents","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","multi-agent"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Reusable Agent Team presets for DeepSeek Harness: a captain plus members with their own prompt, mode"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"l, reasoning effort, and tools."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-agent-team-presets"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"*Concept illustration. See Screenshots for the plugin interface; the captain uses the conversation's"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"tion. See Screenshots for the plugin interface; the captain uses the conversation's selected model.*"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **Community plugin v0.1.9** · Tag\n>\n> This release targets **DeepSeek Harness 0.2.2-rc.1** and add"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"s **individual member chat**: hover a Team in the composer, then select one member to run the Sessio"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"n as that member with its own role card, tools, Team Skills, and model route. It also moves member r"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"outing to `agent.model.select()` and per-step tool admission. Requires Agent Teams; keep 0.1.8 on ol"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"der hosts. Prebuilt artifacts are included."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"### What's new in 0.1.9"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Talk to one member directly.** The composer's Team picker now shows a member panel on hover. Sel"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ecting a member injects its role card, tool policy, Team Skills, and model route into the current Se"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ssion; selecting the captain keeps the Session model unchanged.\n- **DeepSeek Harness 0.2.2-rc.1.** M"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ember routes are recorded through `agent.model.select()` and tool admission is evaluated per step. T"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"he plugin refuses an unusable member route before applying anything instead of falling back to the c"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"aptain.\n- **Custom tool policies are native-only.** On PTC presets the plugin preserves the deployme"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"nt's executor and explicitly refuses custom allow-lists; PTC still works with the all-tools mode.\n- "},{"id":"p7s8","text":"**Built-in troubleshooting skill.** The global `agent-team-presets-troubleshooting` skill explains T"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"eam application, member creation, route evidence, Team Skill visibility, and install/upgrade failure"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"m application, member creation, route evidence, Team Skill visibility, and install/upgrade failures."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Overview"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**dsh-agent-team-presets** is a visual Team preset and private skill manager for DeepSeek Harness. C"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"onfigure a Team once, assign per-agent isolated skills, then select it from the conversation compose"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"r whenever you need it."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"A Team contains a **captain** and any number of **member roles**:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- The captain uses the conversation's selected model, with its own role description, system prompt, "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"and tool policy.\n- Each member can have an independent provider, model, reasoning effort, system pro"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"mpt, tool policy, and assigned Team Skills.\n- The captain summons members through `spawn_team_member"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"`; native Agent Teams provides messaging, the shared task board, and runtime coordination."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"This is a community plugin, not the Harness's bundled `@deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-agent-team-pres"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ets` development package."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Why this plugin?"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness already ships Agent Teams with multi-agent collaboration. In the Harness versions t"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"his plugin supports, per-Team configuration, skill isolation, and reuse are still left to the user, "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"which is what this plugin addresses:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- **Teams are hard to reuse.** In those versions, native teams focus on runtime creation and collabo"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ration, with no visual preset management; this plugin saves, duplicates, categorizes, and reuses nam"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ed presets.\n- **Role setup is repetitive.** Each role's name, description, system prompt, and tool p"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"olicies are configured once instead of re-described every time.\n- **Splitting work across models is "},{"id":"p15s5","text":"awkward.** Every member picks its own model and reasoning effort, so one Team combines models by tas"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"k, while the captain keeps leading on the Session's model.\n- **Tool permissions have no fine-grained"},{"id":"p15s7","text":" entry point.** In those versions the native tool surface offers no per-role allow-list; here the ca"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"ptain and each member carry their own, so roles differ in what they may use.\n- **Skills lack per-age"},{"id":"p15s9","text":"nt scope isolation.** Shipped or user skills are typically registered globally, making all skills vi"},{"id":"p15s10","text":"sible to every agent; this plugin provides a private Team Skill library where skills are discovered "},{"id":"p15s11","text":"**only** by the specific Agent they are assigned to.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- **DeepSeek Harness `>=0.2.2-rc.1 <0.3.0`.** Verified against **`0.2.2-rc.1`**. Each member's route"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" is recorded through `agent.model.select()` for fresh, forked, and cold-resumed execution; the capta"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"in keeps the conversation's model selection. The plugin manager enforces `engines.dsh` from package."},{"id":"p17s4","text":"json.\n- **Custom tool allow-lists require a native Agent preset (standard or cordis).** This Host ca"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"nnot restore an inherited executor after a temporary override, so the plugin preserves the deploymen"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"t's executor and explicitly refuses custom policies on PTC. PTC remains available with the all-tools"},{"id":"p17s7","text":" mode. Select a native Agent preset before using custom policies.\n- **Agent Teams enabled in the tar"},{"id":"p17s8","text":"get profile.** The standard integration is `@deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-agent-team-profile`, which"},{"id":"p17s9","text":" supplies the Team service, tools, and Web roster. This plugin configures and manages Teams; it does"},{"id":"p17s10","text":" not replace that subsystem.\n- **A Web or Desktop profile with Settings and the required client serv"},{"id":"p17s11","text":"ices.** Install into the profile you actually use, typically `web` for the Web GUI or `desktop` for "},{"id":"p17s12","text":"Desktop.\n- **Durable storage and a continuable subagent backend for member execution.** Member creat"},{"id":"p17s13","text":"ion is refused if the storage domain or selected execution backend is unavailable. The default backe"},{"id":"p17s14","text":"nd names are `spawn` and `fork`."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The plugin version (`0.1.9`) and the Harness version (`0.2.2-rc.1`, for example) are separate versio"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"in version (`0.1.9`) and the Harness version (`0.2.2-rc.1`, for example) are separate version lines."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Tool permissions and security"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Known limitation: Windows verification"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The path-separator and executable-resolution fixes are exercised by unit tests that normalize separa"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"tors and by `ENOTDIR` cases, but no Windows machine was available here. Junction handling across vol"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"umes, `PATHEXT` resolution against a real `PATH`, and the full native build chain still need a Windo"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"ws run before the release is described as Windows-verified."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Security boundaries"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- The allow-list is **not a filesystem, process, or network sandbox**. Allowed tools (such as bash) "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"retain their native capabilities. Maintain appropriate Harness sandbox and approval policies.\n- Cust"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"om policy mode disallows general-purpose `run_code` and ordinary `subagent` / `workflow` delegation "},{"id":"p23s4","text":"to preserve strict policy contracts. Use preset Team members for delegation.\n- Managed members requi"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"re their durable configuration on resume. Missing or corrupted records are refused loud rather than "},{"id":"p23s6","text":"falling back to unrestricted defaults."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Troubleshooting and limitations"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
